=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b5cd8fd0-49ba-4b39-ab84-681764d9157c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b5cd8fd0-49ba-4b39-ab84-681764d9157c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7ad5eb2f59d85badEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GEN_Jaheira_LeavingNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GEN_Jaheira_LeavingNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GEN_Jaheira_LeavingNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Inside the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Pouch\" title=\"Old Pouch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Leather_Pouch_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Pouch\" title=\"Old Pouch\">Old Pouch</a> on the roof of <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a> home at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-217&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-53</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I'm not one for goodbyes.\n</p><p>I go in search of my <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">friend</a>. Perhaps you will call it selfish and short-sighted to think of one life among the thousands threatened by the cult. Perhaps I would even agree. But go I must.\n</p><p><br>\nKnow that we share the same goal, and though our paths part for now, i hope to meet you again at our destination.\n</p><p><br>\nGood hunting.\n</p><p>J.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715054627\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2495/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49182/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10595/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUn